# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# --- Dependencies ---
**/node_modules/

# --- Python ---
**/.venv/
**/.dockervenv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info/
*.egg
dist/
build/

# --- Backend ---
backend/poetry.lock
backend/test_router.js
**/views/test
**/components.d.ts

# --- DB ---
*.sql~
*.dump
*.bak

# --- Docker volumes (data は除外、.gitkeep は保持) ---
volumes/db/init/data/*
!volumes/db/init/data/.gitkeep

# --- アップロード画像 (Dockerで保存された画像は除外、.gitkeep は保持) ---
backend/static/images/**
!backend/static/images/**/.gitkeep

# --- Certificates ---
*.cert
*.key

# --- Env files ---
*.env
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.supabase.dev

# --- Logs ---
*.log

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- 一時ファイル / マージ残骸 ---
*.tmp
*.temp
*.orig
*.rej

# --- ビルド生成物 (フロント) ---
**/.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
storybook-static/
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/

# --- IDE / Editor ---
.claude
.cursor
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
.geminiignore
AGENTS.md
# VSCode: 共有フォーマッタ設定 (settings.json) だけ追跡し、個人設定は無視
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

# --- docs ---
# 運用手順書 (docs/*.md) は追跡する。作業用スクラッチのみ無視する。
docs/plan/
docs/responsive-shots/
docs/responsive-check.sh
docs/improvement-report.md
# DB/アップロードのバックアップ（本番運用時に生成）
db/backups/
